      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Catra is pretty sure Adoraâ€™s to-do list for today is absurd, even by her usual energetic standards.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
